      "reason": "Lower with tempfile.TemporaryDirectory(prefix=...) as tmp through py_tempdir_new/py_tempdir_cleanup instead of CPython TemporaryDirectory plus __enter__/__exit__. The helpers live in the same C-only process substrate as native check_output so the pcc-Python runtime archive keeps the symbols after replacing py_process.o."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-04-28-native-subprocess-run-stmt",
      "delta": "ON multi 337\u2192322 (-15), bridge calls unchanged at 10, non-bridge py_cpy_* calls 327\u2192312 (-15). ON per-module sum 6322\u21926315 (-7). Locked descending per-module entry: pipeline.py 419\u2192404; layer1.py rises 3629\u21923637 from the statement-only native run lowering and remains governed by the existing lower ratchet.",
      "reason": "Lower expression-statement subprocess.run(argv, check=True[, capture_output=..., text=...]) through py_subprocess_run. This shape covers the pipeline's make/clang side-effect calls where the CompletedProcess value is ignored. Nonzero exit status raises RuntimeError through the pcc exception path; capture_output=True redirects child output away from stdout/stderr."
