      "delta": "ON multi 286\u21920 (-286), bridge calls 9\u21920, non-bridge py_cpy_* calls 277\u21920. OFF multi 17135\u219216987 (-148). Tight closure shape is now 15 files because pcc.py_frontend.codegen package init falls out of the closure after import refactors.",
